=== PE 852: Coins in a Box ===

=== Simulation (Large Case) ===
N=1000, C=5000
  E[odd boxes] = 499.977526
  Expected empty: 6.721112
  Expected 1 coin: 33.639199

=== Variance Analysis ===
Let X_i = indicator(box i has odd coins)
Var(total) = N*Var(X_1) + N(N-1)*Cov(X_1,X_2)
  N=3 C=3: P_odd=0.481481 Var=0.249657
  N=5 C=5: P_odd=0.461120 Var=0.248488
  N=10 C=10: P_odd=0.446313 Var=0.247118

PE answer: 130.313496
